# Public web rules

- Phase 2 app. Prefer `api` + `pms` work unless Phase 2 is explicitly active.
- Guest-facing only — no staff check-in, reports, or quick-confirm here.
- All bookings write to the shared `apps/api` (`source: website`).
- Availability must come from API calendar truth, not a local-only store.
- Do not add a separate booking backend.
- Brand/marketing UI is fine; keep one clear booking job per flow.
- Also read `apps/web/AGENTS.md` when working here.
